<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mis 15 Años - Mili</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0b0c10;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 15px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .card-container {
            max-width: 450px;
            width: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1f2833, #0b0c10);
            border: 2px solid #c5a059;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 35px 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 15px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.2);
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #c5a059;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: #d4af37;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            font-style: italic;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        }
        .phrase {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #c5c6c7;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .details-box {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.4);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.4);
            padding: 20px 0;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .detail-item {
            margin: 12px 0;
        }
        .detail-item strong {
            color: #c5a059;
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .detail-item span {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            margin: 10px 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c5a059, #d4af37);
            color: #0b0c10;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            border-radius: 30px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.4);
        }
        .footer-note {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #66fcf1;
            margin-top: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card-container">
        <div class="subtitle">Mis 15 Años</div>
        <h1 class="title">Mili</h1>
        
        <p class="phrase">
            "Hay momentos en la vida que son inolvidables, pero compartirlos con quienes más querés los hace imborrables. ¡Acompáñame a festejar mis 15 años!"
        </p>

        <div class="details-box">
            <div class="detail-item">
                <strong>Fecha</strong>
                <span>Próximamente</span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-item">
                <strong>Hora</strong>
                <span>21:00 hs</span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-item">
                <strong>Lugar</strong>
                <span>Salón de Eventos</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <a href="https://wa.me/?text=Hola!%20Confirmo%20mi%20asistencia%20a%20los%2015%20de%20Mili" target="_blank" class="btn">Confirmar Asistencia</a>

        <div class="footer-note">¡Te espero para celebrar juntos!</div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
